type: software
title: "Web4: Trust-Native Ontology for Distributed Intelligence"
abstract: "Open protocol and reference work for persistent agent identity, contextual trust, scoped and delegated authority, provenance, witnessed action, machine-readable law, and multi-agent governance. Web4 is designed to compose with existing identity and authorization standards; Hestia provides a running local governance reference layer."
